.com/lit/ds/symlink/tps552892-q1.pdf" (at 104.14 78.74 0) (hide yes) (show_name no) (do_not_autoplace no) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))) (property "Description" "36 V 8 A four-switch buck-boost converter, external feedback, VQFN-HR-21 (RYQ)" (at 104.14 78.74 0) (hide yes) (show_name no) (do_not_autoplace no) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))) (property "LCSC" "C22375748" (at 104.14 78.74 0) (hide yes) (show_name no) (do_not_autoplace no) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))) (property "MPN" "TPS552892QWRYQRQ1" (at 104.14 78.74 0) (hide yes) (show_name no) (do_not_autoplace no) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))) (property "Manufacturer" "Texas Instruments" (at 104.14 78.74 0) (hide yes) (show_name no) (do_not_autoplace no) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))) (property "Note" "+12V four-switch buck-boost (S9.0, SLVSGT7): 3-36 V in, average inductor limit 7-9 A, VREF 1.188-1.212 V, 966 kHz (R110 20k), FPWM (MODE = VCC), internal LDO (EXTVCC = VCC), no dithering (DITH = GND), CDC open (no droop compensation), PG/CC open. Regulates 12.08 V from the whole 12.5-16.5 V converter input (buck, buck-boost and boost modes; the S8 TPS62933F buck needed 0.995-1.053 duty at low line against its 98 % maximum). EN/UVLO = MAIN_OK. Its output OVP (22.5-24.5 V) is not a 12 V protection: the U20 guard watches the rail" (at 104.14 78.74 0) (hide yes) (show_name no) (do_not_autoplace no) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))) (pin "1" (uuid "1bbcb6d9-bbb9-5cea-beba-8759955623f9")) (pin "10" (uuid "49c31ed8-c873-5af5-bf3e-a605f925337f")) (pin "11" (uuid "7e05e1bf-1ac3-5bb2-b692-de9a6abd4594")) (pin "12" (uuid "747e8ea3-6125-54f0-9071-40122c83b36e")) (pin "13" (uuid "c5762c2e-ecb5-5e5a-92a5-d8ac8c56ce5f")) (pin "14" (uuid "4270c770-3558-55eb-8108-a73ef96ded6a")) (pin "15" (uuid "64456200-28ff-5ce5-8bc9-b5c2e32461d2")) (pin "16" (uuid "a547269c-4800-5f04-aca7-41e0db69e762")) (pin "17" (uuid "a3dddbbb-6e80-5f17-bc19-4dd249afc2d2")) (pin "18" (uuid "aa3dd82d-a3a4-5e3c-ade7-bade77a0fdc9")) (pin "19